<p>Saudi Arabia said it may take military action if Iranian missile and drone attacks on the kingdom continue, as Foreign Minister Prince Faisal bin Farhan hosted emergency talks in Riyadh with Arab and Islamic counterparts on 19 March 2026. Riyadh cast the gathering as both a security consultation and an effort to contain a war now spilling more directly into Gulf states. The warning came as the wider Israel-Iran conflict entered a new phase after an Israeli attack on an Iranian gas field. Even as he said Gulf patience was running thin and that Saudi Arabia has “very significant capabilities,” Prince Faisal said Riyadh was still pushing diplomatic pressure to stop the fighting.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/RsQkKtTB8CI3uf12TUsrAa42dLsf17nPelHLKwl9YibXXJzvwUQVDXMjMdDa04f5QIR1LM-5ZCFDkdS7PRc0FcAarKd-hvUfUK-OiYvhLxwvYXtiNLzhFepLyRM4GiJZeiUyJahz1FHtrYzSTb3LEpw100pz3ke-gMrQM1arzts_evK5FYdzzXu_nli1LfmshJjUw3qH8BcgR0LRa9qyfyNnwKg' alt='“We will not shy away from protecting our country and our economic resources,” the Saudi foreign minister, Prince Faisal bin Farhan, said on Thursday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Trust collapse: Prince Faisal said the limited trust rebuilt with Tehran in recent years had been “shattered,” and warned there would be “almost nothing” left to restore if the attacks did not stop immediately.</li><li>Civilian targets: Saudi officials accused Iran of deliberately striking civilian infrastructure, pointing to attacks on ports, airports, and cities rather than only military or industrial sites.</li><li>Regional bind: Al Jazeera said Gulf states face a diplomatic bind as they weigh how to respond to Iranian pressure while trying to avoid being pulled deeper into the broader war.</li><li>Defense-first posture: Semafor described the Saudi warning as part of a Gulf “defense-first” approach that pairs deterrence with continued diplomatic pressure for de-escalation.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Saudi Arabia: Riyadh’s public message is that any tougher response would be a last resort after repeated attacks, not a first choice, as officials stress both the kingdom’s capabilities and its continued preference for diplomacy. (<a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/saudi-arabia-touts-capabilities-in-warning-to-iran'>Semafor</a>, <a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/19/world/middleeast/iran-missiles-saudi-arabia-riyadh-yanbu.html'>The New York Times</a>)</li><li>Gulf states: Direct spillover from the Israel-Iran war is making it harder for Gulf governments to stay partly detached from the conflict, even as they still want to avoid a full rupture with Tehran. (<a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/wrap-iran-ratchets-up-pressure-on-gulf-states'>Al Jazeera</a>)</li><li>Arab and Islamic ministers: The emergency consultation showed that Arab and Islamic governments wanted to discuss the crisis in a broader regional forum focused on security. (<a href='https://www.thehindu.com/videos/watch-saudi-arabia-hosts-urgent-talks-as-iran-war-escalates-across-gulf/article70761012.ece'>The Hindu</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.reddit.com/r/worldnews/comments/1rxxtan/have_significant_capabilities_saudis_big_warning/'>‘Have significant capabilities’: Saudi&#x27;s big warning to Iran, says it ‘reserves right to take military action’</a> - reddit.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/videos/watch-saudi-arabia-hosts-urgent-talks-as-iran-war-escalates-across-gulf/article70761012.ece'>Watch: Saudi Arabia hosts urgent talks as Iran war escalates across Gulf</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/19/world/middleeast/iran-missiles-saudi-arabia-riyadh-yanbu.html'>Saudi Official Warns Patience Is Limited as Iranian Attacks Barrage Kingdom</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/3/19/wrap-iran-ratchets-up-pressure-on-gulf-states'>War enters new phase as Israel attack on Iran gasfield sparks Gulf response</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/shorts/aCddF8kwZPY'>Iran: Saudi Arabia warns of &#x27;military action&#x27; over repeated attacks • FRANCE 24 English</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.semafor.com/article/03/19/2026/saudi-arabia-touts-capabilities-in-warning-to-iran'>Saudi Arabia touts ‘capabilities’ in warning to Iran</a> - semafor.com</li></ul>